# Secrets never enter git: DB roster passwords, webhook secrets, API tokens.
secrets.env
*.token
.env*
!.env.example

# Personal working notes stay out of git (user's global convention).
worklog.md

# Tool output, regenerated on every run — a per-run stats dump plus its cache.
# Committing it would put a dozen churning files in front of every real diff.
.upward/

.DS_Store
